  intros fr cs C A m md regs s pixs w h d cd dt ad cv ret0 regs0 fr0 S kR bR CK Etop HW FZ0 H2 H4 H10 OP NZ SV Hrm Hrk Hrb K.
  pose proof CK as [T1 T2 T3 T4 T5]. cbn [snd ll_img LLU16] in T5.
